<title>USA: HRE Properties names new president.</title>
<headline>HRE Properties names new president.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>HRE Properties said Thursday that Executive Vice President Willing Biddle has been appointed president.</p>
<p>Biddle succeeds Charles Urstadt, who will retain the chairman and chief executive positions, the company said.</p>
